    "title": "City's sales taxes going to auditor's office for audit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Madison County Journal\nwebsite\nCanton\nCity’s sales taxes going to auditor’s office for audit\nBy Editorials,\n23 hours agoCANTON — The State Auditor has assessed $352,000 in audit fees from sales tax monies collected here that would have otherwise been diverted to the municipality. The Canton mayor aldermen were given an update last week on the ongoing incomplete audit for Fiscal Year 2020 by Jeff Goodwin, Director of the Financial and Compliance Division for the Mississippi State Auditor’s Office.\n1",
